<title>PORTUGAL: Ylds ease at Bank/Portugal draining operation.</title>
<headline>Ylds ease at Bank/Portugal draining operation.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said that it drained 83 billion escudos of four-week funds at 5.8452 percent, against 6.2006 percent previously.</p>
<p>It drained 15 billion escudos of nine-week funds at 5.8133 percent against 6.1243 percent.</p>
<p>The last such operations were on April 8</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
